host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan reweigh -- a run that inherits a reopened matter takes the look again
prompt Keaton set the loop running: be Kyri in Radiant Style, read REMEMBER and the itineraries, pick up the running thread from the newest logs, close open agent-closable reds first, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, and send each finished increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. crux/REDS.md living rows read %96 and %97, both CLOSED and Released, each closed on a witness on metal. No open agent-closable red stands, so the line is clear for constructive work.
think The running thread came off the newest three logs. The reopen rung landed at 20260820.130722 and the ladder-copy meter at 20260820.132327; both recommends named the same two doors. Door A is the fold -- making 637 carried check bodies pub across 82 modules -- which the last lap deliberately parked for Keaton's word. Door B is the arc's own next rung, named agent-doable and unblocked: what a run that inherits a reopened matter actually does with it.
think Took door B. Re-litigating a parked design call would spend the lap on a question the last lap already answered honestly, and the rung is the arc's own crux.
think The name. revisit collides with the recant rung's Review enum, attend is a seated Caravan verb in unprompted.rye, resume is a Zig keyword. reweigh greps clean tree-wide, inherits the arc's own long-running verb -- the arc has been weighing things for thirty rungs -- and passes the Comlink tendency's three tests: clear, fun, safe.
think The shape is meet.rye one tier out. owe books a debt for a run that has not started and meet is the run that inherits it; reopen books a matter open and reweigh is the run that inherits that. So the rung mirrors meet exactly: read the note off the wire, refuse by name, write the receipt, take the matter down, read both back before the report believes anything.
think Both measured runs set reopen to .closes and inherit the same matter from the harness, so the rung below stands still under both marks and only the second look parts them. The harness seats the matter, standing in for the run that booked it -- no supervisor writes its own inheritance.
obs Six RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN claim, each by disarming one guard and rebuilding: skip the receipt write and the run refuses ReweighMisrecorded; read the matter as never standing, ReweighUnopened; read the run as having settled nothing of its own, ReweighUnsettled; receipt some other matter, ReweighMismatched; count one matter both looked at and passed over, ReweighMiscounted; leave the matter standing beside its own receipt, ReweighMisrecorded from the other side.
obs The seventh is the planted control -- write, both read-backs, and the harness's own two reads disarmed at once -- and the selftest printed GREEN while caravan/.reweighs/plan.anew did not exist at all. Seeing that is what makes the reading back a check rather than decoration.
obs The wire reads what the prose claims: plan.anew holds osrw, the four bytes of the reader's own word echoed back whole, and plan.again is down. The receipt lands before the taking down, so a run that falls between the two acts leaves a question open rather than one quietly gone.
obs The ratchet the last lap measured grew as measured: reopen.rye stood at 14,609 lines and reweigh.rye stands at 15,114, about five hundred more, exactly the rate the meter predicted. The fold that would end it still waits on Keaton's word.
obs The council rota doc for this lap was foundations/20260702-165412_the-happy-zone-and-the-thin-edge.md, and it reads directly on the ratchet: the carried checks are a multiplication the ladder solves by copying, where the teaching asks for an addition at the seam. That is the argument for making the checks pub, stated in the tree's own older words.
loom rung=caravan_reweigh lines=15114 elder_lines=14609 growth_lines=505 checks_red_paths=6 planted_controls=1
file caravan/reweigh.rye the rung -- the second look a reopened matter earns, five refusals by name, the receipt read back before the report believes it
file tools/caravan_reweigh_witness.rish the witness on metal -- the selftest read natively, the wire read from outside, every claim bound to a number
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new witness in the choir, so it can never become a guard nobody pulls (REDS %81)
file caravan/README.md the rung's durable entry, beside reopen
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live edge moves to this rung; the prior edge condenses to a pointer
recommend keep-going the arc now corrects a record, carries the correction, hears the answer, records the disagreement, escorts the word, bounds the objection, stands its standing, tells the raiser, reads their reply, carries a live quarrel past the run that heard it, makes the inheriting run answer for it, lets its holder close it, dates it, reads that age aloud, puts a long-standing one before a third hand, reads back what that hand made of it, makes the plan answer that finding on the record, carries the plan's own concession forward, makes the run that inherits it meet it, makes that meeting say what it found, carries that finding home to the reader who won it, reads what that reader makes of it, takes the matter up again when they say it falls short, and now makes the run that inherits that reopening actually look. So the question above is what the second look reports -- nothing yet tells the reader who reopened the matter that anybody looked at it again, exactly as nothing told a raiser how their quarrel came out until the tidings rung. Beside it the ladder-copy fold still stands measured and parked at Keaton's word, growing five hundred lines a lap.
